<h2 style="text-align: justify;"><u>Articles</u> </h2>
<ul>
<li>Kemal İnat, "Anti-Turkey Sentiment in Europe during the Referendum Process", Insight Turkey, Spring 2017, Volume 19, No. 2, ss. 43-61.</li>
<li>Kemal İnat, "Economic Relations between Turkey and Germany", Insight Turkey, Winter 2016, ss. 21-34.</li>
